WEBVTT

00:05:29.047 --> 00:05:31.603
During the first year of medical training,

00:05:31.627 --> 00:05:35.015
as you read through a list of all
the symptoms and diseases,

00:05:35.039 --> 00:05:37.270
suddenly you realize you have all of them.

00:05:37.294 --> 00:05:38.295
(Laughter)

00:05:38.319 --> 00:05:41.391
I have a brother in-law named Bobo,
which is a whole other story.

00:05:41.415 --> 00:05:42.977
Bobo married Amy the unicorn.

00:05:43.001 --> 00:05:44.733
Bobo called me on the phone --

00:05:44.757 --> 00:05:46.902
(Laughter)

00:05:46.926 --> 00:05:48.976
from Yale Medical School,

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.281
and Bobo said, "Shawn, I have leprosy."

00:05:51.305 --> 00:05:52.976
(Laughter)

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.587
Which, even at Yale,
is extraordinarily rare.

00:05:55.611 --> 00:05:57.976
But I had no idea how to console poor Bobo

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.858
because he had just gotten
over an entire week of menopause.